&ldquo;I&rsquo;ve been seeing some suggestions and y&rsquo;all be like, &lsquo;Oh, I want her to be single. I want her to be focused on herself,&rdquo; she said. &ldquo;I want her to be this.&rsquo; B&mdash;h, I&rsquo;m not going to be single for the rest of my life. I was single throughout my whole tour. Single, not talking to nobody, not entertaining nobody, not anything.&rdquo;

Cardi then seemingly referred to a brief reunion with NFL star Stefon Diggs earlier this year, but she left that situation &ldquo;right away.&rdquo;

&ldquo;Ever since then, I&rsquo;ve been living my life. I&rsquo;ve been going outside. I&rsquo;ve been chilling with friends. I&rsquo;ve been vacationing. I&rsquo;ve been drinking. I&rsquo;ve been having a ball,&rdquo; she continued. &ldquo;But even me and my friends, even when we have a ball, we need some entertainment.&rdquo;

Cardi explained that she needs to be a little more exclusive with her relationships, and let fans know that she&rsquo;s just not giving her number out to men that easily. However, the &ldquo;WAP&rdquo; rapper admitted she could do a better job of selecting who to date.

&ldquo;Could I pick better men? Probably. Maybe. So, whatever,&rdquo; she added. &ldquo;Life is cool. Life is everything. But it&rsquo;s just like, all right, the p&mdash;y needs love too.&rdquo;

On Monday (July 20), Cardi B referred to herself as &ldquo;hip-hop&rsquo;s Britney Spears&rdquo; due to all of the media scrutiny surrounding her name and everything she does seemingly turning into a headline.

&ldquo;I&rsquo;m really hip-hop&rsquo;s Britney Spears. I am out here, feeling like motherf&ndash;king Britney, because let me tell you something, right,&rdquo; she said. &ldquo;I got all the tea on these celebrities &hellip;. But guess what? Nobody reports about it. You want to know why? Because nobody gives a f&ndash;k.&rdquo;

The tabloids have been zeroed in on Cardi&rsquo;s love life in recent weeks. According to TMZ , the Grammy-winning rapper was spotted over the weekend in Venice, Italy, having dinner with Nigerian soccer star Maduka Okoye.

Cardi B filed for divorce for the second time from estranged husband Offset in August 2024. She has three kids with the Migos rapper and welcomed a baby boy with Stefon Diggs in November. Cardi and Diggs appeared to have split in February.
